          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labo abazahlukanisela ukungena ensimini yokukhonzela, bezihlambulula, belandelana, besidla inyama yezingulube, lesinengiso, lamagundwane, imisebenzi yabo lemicabango yabo izakuphela, kutsho iNkosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngiyeza ukubutha zonke izizwe lemihlobo yonke, kuzafika, kubone ubukhulu bami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngizabeka isibonakaliso phakathi kwazo, ngithumele abaseleyo ezizweni, eTarshishi, lasePuti, laseLudi, laseMesheki, laseTubali, laseJavani, lasemazweni angasolwandle akhatshana angakezwa udumo lwami, ezingakaboni ubukhulu bami; bazalandisa ngodumo lwami phakathi kwezizwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bazabuyisa bonke abafowenu bebakhupha kuzo zonke izizwe, babe yisipho eNkosini; bazababuyisa ngamabhiza langezinqola zokulwa, langamathala, langezimbongolo, langamakamela, entabeni yami engcwele iJerusalema, kutsho iNkosi, njengabakoIsrayeli beletha iminikelo yabo yempuphu ngezitsha zabo ezihlambulukileyo endlini yeNkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanye babo ngizabenza babe ngabapristi lamaLevi, itsho iNkosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
